{
  "kanji": "資",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 資\ntitle: resources; capital\njlpt: 3\ntags: [jlpt-n3, grade-5, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 13\nradical: 貝\nradicalNumber: 154\nonyomi: [シ]\nkunyomi: []\ndistractors: [貧, 負, 責]\n---\n\n# 資 — resources; capital\n\n**Strokes:** 13 · **Key (radical):** 貝 (no. 154) · **JLPT:** N3 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n資 points to resources that support an activity. In 資金 しきん those resources are funds;\nin [資料](../words/資料.md) しりょう they are materials or information to consult.\nLearning both words prevents a money-only interpretation.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic:** picture the upper 次 as the next task and the lower 貝 as its supply of resources.\nThis is an association for the modern written form, not an origin story.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| シ | on | 資料 しりょう — reference materials; 資金 しきん — funds |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [資料](../words/資料.md) しりょう — materials; documents; data\n- 資金 しきん — funds; capital\n- 資格 しかく — qualifications\n\n## Notes\n\n資料 can be useful information rather than a physical raw material.\n資格 concerns qualifications or capabilities, not the amount of money a person owns.\n[貧](貧.md), [負](負.md), and [責](責.md) share the lower 貝; identify 次 above it in 資.\n\nDictionary: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1312820, 1312700, 1312690.\n",
